<title>USA: Oregon Steel sets capacity at new mill.</title>
<headline>Oregon Steel sets capacity at new mill.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oregon Steel Mills Inc said on Tuesday that capacity at its new combination rolling mill is expected to be in excess of one million tons.</p>
<p>The company said it expects in September to permanently shut down its current rolling mill with an annual capacity of approximately 450,000 tons.</p>
</text>
